		Sir Calder: Good. Seeing it is the first step. But seeing doesn’t fix it by itself.
		Sir Calder: We reacted before we evaluated. That is how contradiction spreads. => END
	- (Stay quiet, nodding)
		Nobita: (Stay quiet, nodding)
